#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:1
msgid "Correct mistakes in your ledger"
msgstr "Corregeix els errors del teu ledger"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:3
msgid ""
"Fix wrong transactions in your ledger without losing track of what "
"changed. Every correction leaves a visible history entry, so you can "
"always see what a transaction looked like before and after. Everything "
"happens on your computer - nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Corregeix els moviments incorrectes del teu ledger sense perdre el rastre"
" del que ha canviat. Cada correcció deixa una entrada d'historial "
"visible, de manera que sempre pots veure quin aspecte tenia un moviment "
"abans i després. Tot passa al teu ordinador: no s'envia res enlloc."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:5
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Abans de començar"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:7
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "Necessita:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:9
msgid ""
"An active taxpayer profile. Every command below works on the active "
"profile; if none is set, the command refuses. See [Set up your taxpayer "
"profile](profile-setup.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil de contribuent actiu. Cada ordre següent treballa sobre el "
"perfil actiu; si no n'hi ha cap, l'ordre es nega. Consulta [Configura el "
"teu perfil de contribuent](profile-setup.md)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:10
msgid ""
"A master-key passphrase. The tool prompts for it the first time it opens "
"your encrypted storage in a session."
msgstr ""
"Una contrasenya de clau mestra. L'eina te la demana el primer cop que "
"obre el teu emmagatzematge xifrat en una sessió."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:11
msgid "A ledger with transactions in it."
msgstr "Un ledger amb moviments."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:13
msgid ""
"To find the transaction you want to fix, list your transactions and view "
"one in detail. The sequence below records an example expense, lists the "
"ledger, and inspects that row:"
msgstr ""
"Per trobar el moviment que vols corregir, llistes els teus moviments i "
"visualitza'n un en detall. La seqüència següent registra una despesa "
"d'exemple, llista el ledger i inspecciona aquella fila:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:19
msgid ""
"The `view` command reports the id, amount, direction, description, and "
"lifecycle state. The [transactions guide](import-bank-statements.md) "
"covers listing and filtering in depth."
msgstr ""
"L'ordre `view` reporta l'id, l'import, la direcció, la descripció i "
"l'estat del cicle de vida. La [guia de moviments](import-bank-"
"statements.md) tracta a fons la llista i el filtratge."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:21
msgid "Pick your fix"
msgstr "Tria la teva correcció"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:23
msgid ""
"If one transaction has a wrong amount, date, or text, [update it"
"](#update-fields-on-a-transaction)."
msgstr ""
"Si un moviment té un import, una data o un text incorrectes, "
"[actualitza'l](#update-fields-on-a-transaction)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:24
msgid ""
"If a transaction should not exist at all, [remove "
"it](#remove-a-transaction)."
msgstr ""
"Si un moviment no hauria d'existir en absolut, "
"[elimina'l](#remove-a-transaction)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:25
msgid ""
"If the same purchase was imported twice, remove the duplicate - or "
"[archive it](#archive-a-transaction) to keep a deliberate trace of it."
msgstr ""
"Si la mateixa compra s'ha importat dues vegades, elimines el duplicat, o "
"bé [arxiva'l](#archive-a-transaction) per conservar-ne un rastre "
"deliberat."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:26
msgid ""
"If one payment covers two different things, [split it](#split-one-"
"transaction-into-parts)."
msgstr ""
"Si un pagament cobreix dues coses diferents, [divideix-lo](#split-one-"
"transaction-into-parts)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:27
msgid ""
"If you split something and want it back together, [merge the parts"
"](#merge-split-parts-back)."
msgstr ""
"Si has dividit una cosa i la vols tornar a ajuntar, [fusiona les parts"
"](#merge-split-parts-back)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:28
msgid ""
"If you're unsure about a transaction and want it out of the way, [stash "
"it](#stash-a-transaction-you-are-unsure-about)."
msgstr ""
"Si dubtes d'un moviment i el vols treure del mig, [posa'l de "
"banda](#stash-a-transaction-you-are-unsure-about)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:29
msgid ""
"If you want to keep a transaction in history but out of everyday lists, "
"[archive it](#archive-a-transaction)."
msgstr ""
"Si vols mantenir un moviment a l'historial però fora de les llistes "
"quotidianes, [arxiva'l](#archive-a-transaction)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:30
msgid ""
"If you stashed or archived a transaction by mistake, [restore it to "
"active](#restore-a-stashed-or-archived-transaction)."
msgstr ""
"Si has posat de banda o arxivat un moviment per error, [restaura'l a "
"actiu](#restore-a-stashed-or-archived-transaction)."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:32
msgid "Update fields on a transaction"
msgstr "Actualitza camps d'un moviment"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:34
msgid ""
"Change one or more fields directly. The sequence records a chair at the "
"wrong price, corrects the amount and description, and confirms the "
"correction:"
msgstr ""
"Canvia un o més camps directament. La seqüència registra una cadira al "
"preu incorrecte, corregeix l'import i la descripció i confirma la "
"correcció:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:40
msgid ""
"Each flag fully replaces that field - write the complete new value, not "
"an addition to the old one. Write the amount as a positive figure - the "
"direction field carries whether money came in or went out, and a negative"
" amount is refused. The updatable fields are: date, value-date, amount, "
"direction, currency, counterparty, description, taxable-base, iva-rate, "
"iva-amount, irpf-category, notes, and group."
msgstr ""
"Cada indicador substitueix completament aquell camp: escriu el valor nou "
"complet, no una addició a l'antic. Escriu l'import com una xifra "
"positiva: el camp de direcció indica si els diners han entrat o han "
"sortit, i un import negatiu es rebutja. Els camps actualitzables són: "
"date, value-date, amount, direction, currency, counterparty, description,"
" taxable-base, iva-rate, iva-amount, irpf-category, notes i group."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:42
msgid ""
"An update gives the transaction a new ID - the update output prints it. "
"You don't have to track the change for read commands: an ID you wrote "
"down before the update still answers in `history`, `view`, and `track`, "
"resolving to the corrected transaction, exactly as the `view` above does."
" For a further mutation - another `update`, `classify`, or `archive` - "
"use the current ID from the update output or from `list`, because those "
"commands act on the live transaction."
msgstr ""
"Una actualització dona un ID nou al moviment: la sortida de "
"l'actualització l'imprimeix. No cal que facis el seguiment del canvi per "
"a les ordres de lectura: un ID que hagis anotat abans de l'actualització "
"continua responent a `history`, `view` i `track`, resolent-se al moviment"
" corregit, exactament com fa el `view` anterior. Per a una mutació "
"posterior (una altra `update`, `classify` o `archive`), utilitza l'ID "
"actual de la sortida de l'actualització o de `list`, perquè aquestes "
"ordres actuen sobre el moviment viu."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:44
msgid ""
"Update works on active transactions only. Archived and stashed "
"transactions refuse it, as does a split parent - the active parts of a "
"split can be updated normally."
msgstr ""
"L'actualització només funciona sobre moviments actius. Els moviments "
"arxivats i posats de banda la rebutgen, igual que un pare de divisió: les"
" parts actives d'una divisió es poden actualitzar amb normalitat."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:46
msgid "Remove a transaction"
msgstr "Elimina un moviment"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:48
msgid ""
"Remove deletes a transaction from your active records. Preview it first "
"with `--dry-run`, then remove it for real. The removed id no longer "
"resolves, which is how the sequence confirms the deletion:"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar suprimeix un moviment dels teus registres actius. Previsualitza-"
"ho primer amb `--dry-run` i, tot seguit, elimina'l de veritat. L'id "
"eliminat ja no es resol, que és com la seqüència confirma la supressió:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:54
msgid ""
"A removed transaction is gone from your active records: the final `view` "
"refuses because the id no longer names an active row."
msgstr ""
"Un moviment eliminat ja no és als teus registres actius: el `view` final "
"es nega perquè l'id ja no anomena una fila activa."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:56
msgid "Split one transaction into parts"
msgstr "Divideix un moviment en parts"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:58
msgid ""
"When one payment covers two different things - for example, a card "
"payment that mixes business and personal items - split it into parts. "
"Amounts and descriptions pair up one per part: the first amount goes with"
" the first description, and so on:"
msgstr ""
"Quan un pagament cobreix dues coses diferents (per exemple, un pagament "
"amb targeta que barreja articles de negoci i personals), divideix-lo en "
"parts. Els imports i les descripcions s'aparellen un per part: el primer "
"import va amb la primera descripció, i així successivament:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:64
msgid ""
"The original transaction becomes the split parent, and the parts carry "
"the balance from then on. The split output prints one "
"`child_transactions` row per part, each with a short `display_id` and a "
"full `full_id`. Copy those ids - the merge command needs them to undo the"
" split."
msgstr ""
"El moviment original esdevé el pare de la divisió, i les parts en porten "
"el saldo a partir d'aleshores. La sortida de la divisió imprimeix una "
"fila `child_transactions` per part, cadascuna amb un `display_id` curt i "
"un `full_id` complet. Copia aquests ids: l'ordre de fusió els necessita "
"per desfer la divisió."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:66
msgid "Merge split parts back"
msgstr "Torna a fusionar les parts d'una divisió"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:68
msgid ""
"To undo a split, merge the parts back together using the child ids the "
"split printed. Name every sibling part - the command refuses a partial "
"merge. The sequence splits a payment, then merges the parts into one "
"fresh transaction:"
msgstr ""
"Per desfer una divisió, torna a fusionar les parts utilitzant els ids "
"fills que la divisió va imprimir. Anomena cada part germana: l'ordre "
"rebutja una fusió parcial. La seqüència divideix un pagament i, tot "
"seguit, fusiona les parts en un moviment nou:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:74
msgid ""
"The parts and the original parent move to history, and the merge creates "
"a fresh transaction in their place. If you no longer have the split "
"output, the parts are active rows: run `aeat app ledger list` and read "
"their ids from the listing."
msgstr ""
"Les parts i el pare original passen a l'historial, i la fusió crea un "
"moviment nou al seu lloc. Si ja no tens la sortida de la divisió, les "
"parts són files actives: executa `aeat app ledger list` i llegeix-ne els "
"ids del llistat."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:76
msgid "Stash a transaction you are unsure about"
msgstr "Posa de banda un moviment del qual dubta"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:78
msgid ""
"Stash sets a transaction aside for later. A stashed transaction is kept "
"out of ordinary work. The sequence stashes a row and confirms its new "
"lifecycle state:"
msgstr ""
"Posar de banda deixa un moviment a part per a més endavant. Un moviment "
"posat de banda es manté fora del treball ordinari. La seqüència posa de "
"banda una fila i confirma el seu nou estat del cicle de vida:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:84
msgid ""
"Use stash for a row you have not resolved yet and archive for a row you "
"have deliberately set aside, such as a confirmed duplicate. Both are "
"reversible: [restore](#restore-a-stashed-or-archived-transaction) returns"
" the row to active. The `stash` command prints the transaction's fields "
"but not its new lifecycle state, so `view` is how you confirm the change "
"took effect."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza posar de banda per a una fila que encara no has resolt i arxivar"
" per a una fila que has deixat a part deliberadament, com ara un duplicat"
" confirmat. Totes dues són reversibles: [restaurar](#restore-a-stashed-"
"or-archived-transaction) torna la fila a actiu. L'ordre `stash` imprimeix"
" els camps del moviment però no el seu nou estat del cicle de vida, de "
"manera que `view` és com confirma que el canvi ha tingut efecte."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:86
msgid "Archive a transaction"
msgstr "Arxiva un moviment"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:88
msgid ""
"Archive keeps a transaction in history but out of ordinary work - it's "
"the right choice for duplicates you want to keep a deliberate trace of. "
"The sequence archives a duplicate row and confirms the state change:"
msgstr ""
"Arxivar manté un moviment a l'historial però fora del treball ordinari: "
"és l'opció adequada per a duplicats dels quals vols conservar un rastre "
"deliberat. La seqüència arxiva una fila duplicada i confirma el canvi "
"d'estat:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:94
msgid ""
"Like stash, the command prints the transaction's fields but not its new "
"lifecycle state, so `view` confirms the row now reads `ARCHIVED`."
msgstr ""
"Com posar de banda, l'ordre imprimeix els camps del moviment però no el "
"seu nou estat del cicle de vida, de manera que `view` confirma que la "
"fila ara diu `ARCHIVED`."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:96
msgid "Restore a stashed or archived transaction"
msgstr "Restaura un moviment posat de banda o arxivat"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:98
msgid ""
"If you stashed or archived a transaction by mistake, restore it to "
"active. Restore is the inverse of stash and archive: the row returns to "
"your everyday lists and totals. The sequence stashes a row and then "
"restores it:"
msgstr ""
"Si has posat de banda o arxivat un moviment per error, restaura'l a "
"actiu. Restaurar és la inversa de posar de banda i arxivar: la fila torna"
" a les teves llistes i totals quotidians. La seqüència posa de banda una "
"fila i després la restaura:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:104
msgid ""
"Restore accepts the same id prefix the other commands accept. To recover "
"several rows stashed by mistake, restore each one by id - you do not need"
" to reset the whole ledger. List does not have a stashed-only filter, so "
"identify the stashed rows from the ids you stashed, or from each row's "
"lifecycle state shown by `view`."
msgstr ""
"Restaurar accepta el mateix prefix d'id que accepten les altres ordres. "
"Per recuperar diverses files posades de banda per error, restaura "
"cadascuna per id: no cal que restableixis tot el ledger. `list` no té cap"
" filtre de només posades de banda, de manera que identifiques les files "
"posades de banda a partir dels ids que has posat de banda, o de l'estat "
"del cicle de vida de cada fila que mostra `view`."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:106
msgid ""
"Restore refuses a row that is already active, and it refuses a row whose "
"period you have already filed - restoring it would change the inputs "
"behind a return you have presented. Restore one of these only after you "
"have corrected the filing through an amendment."
msgstr ""
"Restaurar rebutja una fila que ja és activa, i rebutja una fila el "
"període de la qual ja has presentat: restaurar-la canviaria les dades "
"d'entrada darrere d'una declaració que has presentat. Restaura'n una "
"d'aquestes només després d'haver corregit la presentació mitjançant una "
"rectificació."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:108
msgid "Review what changed"
msgstr "Revisa què ha canviat"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:110
msgid ""
"Every correction is recorded. To see every action on a transaction in "
"order, run `ledger history`. The sequence splits a payment, then reads "
"the history with the sibling flag to follow the whole split family:"
msgstr ""
"Cada correcció queda registrada. Per veure cada acció sobre un moviment "
"en ordre, executa `ledger history`. La seqüència divideix un pagament i, "
"tot seguit, llegeix l'historial amb l'indicador de germans per seguir "
"tota la família de la divisió:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:116
msgid ""
"The history lists each action in order with its timestamp and event "
"reference. Details such as the reason and the new values are in the JSON "
"output. To see a value before a change, read the earlier events in the "
"history. The [CLI reference](../cli/index.rst) covers every field the "
"history shows."
msgstr ""
"L'historial llista cada acció en ordre amb la seva marca de temps i la "
"referència de l'esdeveniment. Detalls com ara la raó i els nous valors "
"són a la sortida JSON. Per veure un valor abans d'un canvi, llegeix els "
"esdeveniments anteriors de l'historial. La [referència de la "
"CLI](../cli/index.rst) tracta cada camp que mostra l'historial."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:118
msgid "Evidence and corrections"
msgstr "Evidència i correccions"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:120
msgid ""
"An attached evidence record - a receipt or invoice - is not deleted when "
"you correct a transaction. After a split or merge, check the new "
"transactions and re-attach evidence where needed. The [evidence guide"
"](ledger-evidence.md) covers attaching and checking evidence."
msgstr ""
"Un registre d'evidència adjunt (un rebut o una factura) no s'elimina quan"
" corregeixes un moviment. Després d'una divisió o una fusió, comprova els"
" nous moviments i torna a adjuntar l'evidència on calgui. La [guia "
"d'evidència](ledger-evidence.md) tracta com adjuntar i comprovar "
"l'evidència."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:122
msgid "Start over as a last resort"
msgstr "Comença de nou com a últim recurs"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:124
msgid ""
"If the ledger is beyond repair - for example, after importing the wrong "
"files repeatedly - clear it and rebuild. Preview first, then confirm. The"
" sequence records a row, previews the reset, clears the ledger, and "
"confirms nothing remains:"
msgstr ""
"Si el ledger no té reparació (per exemple, després d'importar els fitxers"
" incorrectes repetidament), buida'l i reconstrueix-lo. Previsualitza "
"primer i després confirma. La seqüència registra una fila, previsualitza "
"el restabliment, buida el ledger i confirma que no queda res:"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:130
msgid ""
"Reset clears the whole ledger for the active profile. Use the "
"[transactions guide](import-bank-statements.md) to rebuild it from your "
"statements."
msgstr ""
"El restabliment buida tot el ledger del perfil actiu. Utilitza la [guia "
"de moviments](import-bank-statements.md) per reconstruir-lo a partir dels"
" teus extractes."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:132
msgid "Where to get help"
msgstr "On obtenir ajuda"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If a command refuses or fails, check the [troubleshooting "
"guide](troubleshooting.md). Unfamiliar terms are explained in the "
"{doc}`glossary </_generated/glossary>`. Before sharing command output "
"with anyone, strip tax identifiers such as your NIF, CIF, DNI, NIE, or "
"NII."
msgstr ""
"Si una ordre es nega o falla, consultes la [guia de resolució de "
"problemes](troubleshooting.md). Els termes desconeguts s'expliquen al "
"{doc}`glossari </_generated/glossary>`. Abans de compartir la sortida "
"d'una ordre amb ningú, elimina els identificadors fiscals com ara el teu "
"NIF, CIF, DNI, NIE o NII."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:136
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "Passos següents"

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:138
msgid ""
"[Import and manage transactions](import-bank-statements.md) - bring in "
"new transactions."
msgstr ""
"[Importa i gestiona els moviments](import-bank-statements.md): incorpora "
"moviments nous."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:139
msgid ""
"[Attach evidence to transactions](ledger-evidence.md) - back your "
"corrections with receipts."
msgstr ""
"[Adjunta evidència als moviments](ledger-evidence.md): recolza les teves "
"correccions amb rebuts."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:140
msgid ""
"[Classify transactions](classify-transactions.md) - prepare corrected "
"rows for tax calculations."
msgstr ""
"[Classifica els moviments](classify-transactions.md): prepara les files "
"corregides per als càlculs fiscals."

#: ../../how-to/correct-ledger-entries.md:141
msgid ""
"[CLI reference](../cli/index.rst) - full field detail for every ledger "
"command."
msgstr ""
"[Referència de la CLI](../cli/index.rst): detall complet dels camps de "
"cada ordre del ledger."

